"<li><b>%filterinput</b>: input specification</li>"
"<li><b>%filteroutput</b>: output specification</li>"
"<li><b>%psu</b>: the page size in upper case</li>"
"<li><b>%psl</b>: the page size in lower case</li></ul>"
